  "tileChanged": "measured: Window.tileChanged fires for Tile.manage (true) and Tile.unmanage (false), but not inside the call: both emissions were logged after the call returned (w.tile itself changes synchronously)",
  "unmanageGeometry": "measured: after Tile.unmanage KWin itself restores the window's pre-manage frame (here the old 3-window slot, overlapping a peer); Plastile issued no write",
  "toggleFloatFromNative": "measured: from a native (quick-tile) yield, the first window.toggle-float re-adopts into the layout, the second floats at the quick-tile rect, the third tiles again. The task wording 'toggle-float twice returns the window to the layout' does not hold after exactly two toggles; it holds after one (and three)",
  "defect": "native-unmanage-config-L14 FAILS: after Tile.unmanage the window is yielded only because engine.nativeTileChanged(false) leaves mode 'native' without reclassifying; any later reclassify (configuration activation reclassifies every window) derives mode from r.nativeTile=false and silently re-tiles it"
